Subject: [PATCH v2 2/3] treewide: remove SPDX "WITH Linux-syscall-note" from kernel-space headers again
Date:   Thu, 25 Jul 2019 16:58:32 +0900
Message-Id: <20190725075833.3481-2-yamada.masahiro@socionext.com>
